cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TabMon-Bench, please cite the accompanying manuscript and this software artifact."
title: "TabMon-Bench: When Can Label-Free Model Monitoring Be Trusted under Tabular Distribution Shifts?"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Xuan Trung
version: "0.13.0"
date-released: 2026-09-28
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  TabMon-Bench evaluates the reliability of label-free risk estimation,
  shift attribution, and sequential harmful-shift detection on controlled
  tabular deployment streams while withholding target labels from monitors.
keywords:
  - label-free model monitoring
  - distribution shift
  - performance estimation
  - tabular machine learning
